  "What language the app is in, and what language film and show descriptions are fetched in.": "En quina lenga es l'aplicacion, e en quina lenga son recuperadas las descripcions de filmes e de serias.",
  "What sits behind the app": "Çò que se tròba darrièr l'aplicacion",
  "Whatever the disk allows": "Çò que lo disc permet",
  "Where downloads go": "Ont van los telecargaments",
  "Where films and episodes are written. Torrents already downloaded stay where they are.": "Ont los filmes e los episòdis son escriches. Los torrents ja telecargats demòran ont son.",
  "Where to keep downloads": "Ont gardar los telecargaments",
  "Which drive films and episodes are written to — a plugged-in stick usually holds far more than the box itself. Uninstalling the app still removes them. Torrents already downloaded stay where they are.": "Sus quin disc los filmes e los episòdis son escriches — una clau brancada conten generalament plan mai que la bóstia ela meteissa. Desinstallar l'aplicacion los lèva çaquelà. Los torrents ja telecargats demòran ont son.",
  "Worth turning on wherever the app feels heavy — a television or a set-top box most of all, where the graphics chip is a fraction of a laptop's.": "Val la pena de l'activar pertot ont l'aplicacion sembla pesuga — sus un televisor o un decodificador subretot, ont la piuse grafica es una fraccion d'aquela d'un portable.",
  "Writer": "Escenari",
