  "{drive} is formatted FAT32, which can't hold a single file over {limit}. Bigger releases are dimmed in the source list and are never picked automatically — everything smaller works normally.": "{drive} es formatat en FAT32, que pòt pas contenir un fichièr de mai de {limit}. Las publicacions mai grandas son atenuadas dins la lista de las fonts e son pas jamai causidas automaticament — tot çò qu'es mai pichon fonciona normalament.",
  "{drive} is plugged in, but nothing can be written to it — this device doesn't support the format the drive is in. Formatting it here fixes that, and erases whatever is on the drive.": "{drive} es brancat, mas res pòt pas i èsser escrich — aqueste aparelh pren pas en carga lo format del disc. Lo formatar aicí resòlv aquò, e escafa tot çò que i a.",
